{"id":"10b22c276ea785fcc9cc051011a4a1541ec2d0b4","axis":"silent","repo":"TanStack/router","sha":"10b22c276ea785fcc9cc051011a4a1541ec2d0b4","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/README.md","lines":["@@ -60,6 +60,7 @@ be attributed to a specific feature area."," | `history`                                | History push/replace/back/forward traversal, location masking, registered-but-never-blocking `useBlocker`, and `useCanGoBack`/`useLocation` subscriptions.                                                                                                                                                                           |"," | `hydration`                              | Initial DOM hydration: execute the SSR payload, restore `beforeLoad` context and loader data, and hydrate 192 ordinary and eight hash-sensitive Links through their follow-up effects in React and Solid.                                                                                                                            |"," | `link-churn`                             | Links that depart, stay and mount: 30 `/hub` layout Links stay while 100 `/hub/list` leaf Links leave (alone, or with the layout to `/other`) and remount on return; a search-only change rebuilds updater and `to=\".\"` Links. Unlike `links`, whose root-layout Links never depart.                                                 |","+| `link-mount`                             | Link setup and teardown without navigation: each step synchronously mounts or unmounts 300 Links on the index route, half plain `to=\"/about\"` and half `to=\"/posts/$postId\"` with `params`, `search` and `activeProps`. Runs with the default `defaultPreload: false` and again with `'intent'`, which attaches the intent handlers. |"," | `links`                                  | Per-navigation cost of ~200 mounted `<Link>`s: link prop building, active-state recompute across `activeOptions` variants, `activeProps` swaps, and `useMatchRoute` probes (the `MatchRoute` component is avoided: vue-router's implementation leaks one subscription per render).                                                   |"," | `loaders`                                | Client loader dispatch: always-stale re-runs (`staleTime: 0`), cached revisits (re-run once per lap by the `invalidate` step), `loaderDeps`-keyed caching, `router.invalidate()`, and `useLoaderData` selectors.                                                                                                                     |"," | `mount`                                  | Cold start: `createRouter` (route-tree processing) + first render + initial `router.load()` + unmount, with a fresh router per mount.                                                                                                                                                                                                |","@@ -76,7 +77,7 @@ scenarios follow these navigation/mount conventions:"," "," - Apps are built with `NODE_ENV=production` (`minify: false`) into `dist/app.js`; benches import the built bundle, so production package builds and production JSX output are measured, not dev transforms."," - Scenarios behave like a real user app: navigation happens through `<Link>` clicks dispatched on real anchor elements (unless a scenario specifically measures the imperative API), the router uses the default browser history, and `scrollRestoration` is enabled.","-- Each benchmark iteration advances a fixed, circular sequence of steps; every step awaits the router's `onRendered` event, so render work is included and steps cannot overlap. No two consecutive steps may target the same location, and the sequence ends back on the initial route.","+- Each benchmark iteration advances a fixed, circular sequence of steps; every step awaits the router's `onRendered` event, so render work is included and steps cannot overlap. Steps that leave the location unchanged, like `link-mount`'s, resolve once their render has committed instead. No two consecutive steps may target the same location, and the sequence ends back on the initial route."," - Setup runs one warm-up lap through the sequence and asserts each step's observable output (e.g. `document.title`), so a scenario that silently stops doing its work fails instead of reporting a fast time."," - Apps are mounted and disposed outside timing by `benchLifecycle` (`benchmarks/cpu-simulation.ts`): CodSpeed measures a single invocation, so every invocation gets a freshly mounted app; plain `vitest bench` keeps one app per warmup/run phase. Bench functions must be `async` functions, because CodSpeed's Vitest 5 provider awaits only `AsyncFunction`s."," - Determinism: no wall-clock timers (async work is resolved promises or counted `setTimeout(0)` hops), `staleTime`/`gcTime` only ever `0` or effectively-infinite, no `Math.random`/`Date.now` in the measured loop. Scroll restoration uses `getScrollRestorationKey: (location) => location.pathname` so its cache stays bounded (the default random per-entry key grows one cache entry per push navigation). The `mount` scenario opts out of `scrollRestoration` entirely and destroys its history on unmount — both register page-lifetime globals that would leak across its mount/unmount loop."],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/package.json","lines":["@@ -66,6 +66,7 @@","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-history-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-hydration-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-react\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-loaders-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-mount-react\",","@@ -96,6 +97,7 @@","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-history-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-hydration-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-solid\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-loaders-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-mount-solid\",","@@ -125,6 +127,7 @@","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-head-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-history-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-vue\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-loaders-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-mount-vue\",","@@ -209,10 +212,13 @@","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-hydration-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-hydration-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-react\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-solid\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-solid\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-churn-vue\",","+              \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-links-vue\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-loaders-react\",","               \"@benchmarks/client-nav-loaders-solid\","],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/harness.ts","lines":["@@ -57,6 +57,15 @@ export type ScenarioStep =","       testId: string","       settleHops?: number","     }","+  | {","+      /**","+       * Runs app work that leaves the router location unchanged, such as","+       * mounting or unmounting a list of Links. `run` must resolve only after","+       * that work has rendered.","+       */","+      type: 'run'","+      run: () => void | Promise<void>","+    }","   | { type: 'navigate'; getOptions: () => object }","   | { type: 'preload'; getOptions: () => object; settleHops?: number }","   | { type: 'invalidate'; settleHops?: number }","@@ -295,6 +304,11 @@ export interface ScenarioSetupOptions {","    * browser history traversal. All other scenarios use fresh memory history.","    */","   historyMode?: 'memory' | 'browser'","+  /**","+   * Test id that must render before the warm-up lap. Needed by scenarios","+   * whose steps click no links, so nothing else waits for the first render.","+   */","+  readyTestId?: string"," }"," "," function warnAboutDevMode(frameworkLabel: string) {","@@ -394,6 +408,10 @@ export function createScenarioSetup(options: ScenarioSetupOptions) {","           await settle(step.settleHops ?? 4)","           return","         }","+        case 'run': {","+          await step.run()","+          return","+        }","         case 'navigate': {","           const renderedPromise = rendered()","           router.navigate(step.getOptions())","@@ -434,6 +452,9 @@ export function createScenarioSetup(options: ScenarioSetupOptions) {","     await router.load()"," ","     const linkTestIds = new Set<string>()","+    if (options.readyTestId) {","+      linkTestIds.add(options.readyTestId)","+    }","     for (const step of options.steps) {","       if (typeof step === 'string') {","         linkTestIds.add(step)"],"additions":21,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/project.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@","+{","+  \"name\": \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-react\",","+  \"projectType\": \"application\",","+  \"targets\": {","+    \"build:client\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"cache\": false,","+      \"dependsOn\": [","+        {","+          \"projects\": [\"@tanstack/react-router\", \"@tanstack/router-plugin\"],","+          \"target\": \"build\"","+        }","+      ],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"NODE_ENV=production vite build --config {projectRoot}/vite.config.ts\"","+      }","+    },","+    \"test:types:client\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"dependsOn\": [","+        {","+          \"projects\": [\"@tanstack/react-router\", \"@tanstack/router-plugin\"],","+          \"target\": \"build\"","+        }","+      ],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"tsc -p {projectRoot}/tsconfig.json --noEmit\"","+      }","+    },","+    \"test:flame\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"cache\": false,","+      \"dependsOn\": [\"build:client\"],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"NODE_ENV=production flame run --md-format=detailed --delay=none --node-options=\\\"--stack-size=65500\\\" ./scenarios/link-mount/react/speed.flame.ts\",","+        \"cwd\": \"benchmarks/client-nav\"","+      }","+    }","+  }","+}"],"additions":40,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/setup.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+import { createScenarioSetup } from '../../harness'","+import { assertStepResult, createScenarioSteps, readyTestId } from '../shared'","+import type { LinkMountPreload } from '../shared'","+import type * as App from './src/main'","+","+const appModulePath = './dist/app.js'","+const { mountIntentTestApp, mountTestApp, setLinksVisible } = (await import(","+  /* @vite-ignore */ appModulePath","+)) as typeof App","+","+export function setup(preload: LinkMountPreload = 'default') {","+  return createScenarioSetup({","+    frameworkLabel: 'React',","+    mount: preload === 'intent' ? mountIntentTestApp : mountTestApp,","+    steps: createScenarioSteps(setLinksVisible),","+    assertAfterStep: assertStepResult,","+    readyTestId,","+  })","+}"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/speed-intent.bench.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@","+import { test } from 'vitest'","+import { benchLifecycle } from '../../../../cpu-simulation'","+import { benchOptions, ticksPerIteration } from '../shared'","+import { setup } from './setup'","+","+// Separate file, so its worker's JIT feedback never mixes the two router","+// configurations.","+test('client-link-mount-intent', async ({ bench }) => {","+  const scenario = setup('intent')","+","+  await bench(","+    'client-link-mount intent loop (react)',","+    benchLifecycle(scenario),","+    async () => {","+      for (let i = 0; i < ticksPerIteration; i++) {","+        await scenario.tick()","+      }","+      await scenario.finishBatch()","+    },","+  ).run(benchOptions)","+})"],"additions":21,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/speed.bench.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+import { test } from 'vitest'","+import { benchLifecycle } from '../../../../cpu-simulation'","+import { benchOptions, ticksPerIteration } from '../shared'","+import { setup } from './setup'","+","+test('client-link-mount', async ({ bench }) => {","+  const scenario = setup()","+","+  await bench(","+    'client-link-mount loop (react)',","+    benchLifecycle(scenario),","+    async () => {","+      for (let i = 0; i < ticksPerIteration; i++) {","+        await scenario.tick()","+      }","+      await scenario.finishBatch()","+    },","+  ).run(benchOptions)","+})"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/speed.flame.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@","+import { window } from '../../../jsdom.ts'","+import { setup } from './setup.ts'","+","+const DURATION_MS = 10_000","+","+const test = setup()","+","+try {","+  await test.before()","+","+  const startedAt = performance.now()","+  while (performance.now() - startedAt < DURATION_MS) {","+    await test.tick()","+  }","+} finally {","+  test.after()","+  window.close()","+}"],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/linkList.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@","+import { Fragment, useLayoutEffect, useState } from 'react'","+import { flushSync } from 'react-dom'","+import { Link } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+import { linkListTestId, linkRows } from '../../shared'","+","+let linksVisible = false","+const setters = new Set<(visible: boolean) => void>()","+","+export function resetLinksVisible() {","+  linksVisible = false","+}","+","+// `flushSync` commits the render and its passive effects before returning, so","+// a step includes every Link's mount or unmount work.","+export function setLinksVisible(visible: boolean) {","+  linksVisible = visible","+  flushSync(() => {","+    for (const setVisible of setters) {","+      setVisible(visible)","+    }","+  })","+}","+","+function LinkList() {","+  return (","+    <div data-testid={linkListTestId}>","+      {linkRows.map(({ postId, page }) => (","+        <Fragment key={postId}>","+          <Link to=\"/about\">About</Link>","+          <Link","+            to=\"/posts/$postId\"","+            params={{ postId }}","+            search={{ page }}","+            activeProps={{ className: 'active-link' }}","+          >","+            {`Post ${postId}`}","+          </Link>","+        </Fragment>","+      ))}","+    </div>","+  )","+}","+","+export function LinkListToggle() {","+  const [visible, setVisible] = useState(() => linksVisible)","+","+  // Register in a layout effect, which runs in the commit that renders the","+  // ready marker. `useSyncExternalStore` subscribes in a passive effect, which","+  // can still be pending when the first step runs, so that step would be lost.","+  useLayoutEffect(() => {","+    setters.add(setVisible)","+    return () => {","+      setters.delete(setVisible)","+    }","+  }, [])","+","+  return visible ? <LinkList /> : null","+}"],"additions":58,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/main.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@","+import type { RouterHistory } from '@tanstack/history'","+import { RouterProvider, createRouter } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+import { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'","+import { resetLinksVisible } from './linkList'","+import { routeTree } from './routeTree.gen'","+import type { LinkMountPreload } from '../../shared'","+","+export { setLinksVisible } from './linkList'","+","+export function createTestRouter(","+  history: RouterHistory,","+  preload: LinkMountPreload = 'default',","+) {","+  return createRouter({","+    routeTree,","+    history,","+    defaultPreload: preload === 'intent' ? 'intent' : undefined,","+    scrollRestoration: true,","+    // Key the scroll-restoration cache by pathname instead of the default","+    // random per-entry location key, so the cache stays bounded.","+    getScrollRestorationKey: (location) => location.pathname,","+  })","+}","+","+declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {","+  interface Register {","+    router: ReturnType<typeof createTestRouter>","+  }","+}","+","+function mount(","+  container: HTMLElement,","+  history: RouterHistory,","+  preload: LinkMountPreload,","+) {","+  resetLinksVisible()","+  const router = createTestRouter(history, preload)","+","+  const reactRoot = createRoot(container)","+  reactRoot.render(<RouterProvider router={router} />)","+","+  return {","+    router,","+    unmount() {","+      reactRoot.unmount()","+    },","+  }","+}","+","+export function mountTestApp(container: HTMLElement, history: RouterHistory) {","+  return mount(container, history, 'default')","+}","+","+export function mountIntentTestApp(","+  container: HTMLElement,","+  history: RouterHistory,","+) {","+  return mount(container, history, 'intent')","+}"],"additions":59,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@","+/* eslint-disable */","+","+// @ts-nocheck","+","+// noinspection JSUnusedGlobalSymbols","+","+// This file was automatically generated by TanStack Router.","+// You should NOT make any changes in this file as it will be overwritten.","+// Additionally, you should also exclude this file from your linter and/or formatter to prevent it from being checked or modified.","+","+import { Route as rootRouteImport } from './routes/__root'","+import { Route as IndexRouteImport } from './routes/index'","+import { Route as AboutRouteImport } from './routes/about'","+import { Route as PostsPostIdRouteImport } from './routes/posts.$postId'","+","+const IndexRoute = IndexRouteImport.update({","+  id: '/',","+  path: '/',","+  getParentRoute: () => rootRouteImport,","+} as any)","+const AboutRoute = AboutRouteImport.update({","+  id: '/about',","+  path: '/about',","+  getParentRoute: () => rootRouteImport,","+} as any)","+const PostsPostIdRoute = PostsPostIdRouteImport.update({","+  id: '/posts/$postId',","+  path: '/posts/$postId',","+  getParentRoute: () => rootRouteImport,","+} as any)","+","+export interface FileRoutesByFullPath {","+  '/': typeof IndexRoute","+  '/about': typeof AboutRoute","+  '/posts/$postId': typeof PostsPostIdRoute","+}","+export interface FileRoutesByTo {","+  '/': typeof IndexRoute","+  '/about': typeof AboutRoute","+  '/posts/$postId': typeof PostsPostIdRoute","+}","+export interface FileRoutesById {","+  __root__: typeof rootRouteImport","+  '/': typeof IndexRoute","+  '/about': typeof AboutRoute","+  '/posts/$postId': typeof PostsPostIdRoute","+}","+export interface FileRouteTypes {","+  fileRoutesByFullPath: FileRoutesByFullPath","+  fullPaths: '/' | '/about' | '/posts/$postId'","+  fileRoutesByTo: FileRoutesByTo","+  to: '/' | '/about' | '/posts/$postId'","+  id: '__root__' | '/' | '/about' | '/posts/$postId'","+  fileRoutesById: FileRoutesById","+}","+export interface RootRouteChildren {","+  IndexRoute: typeof IndexRoute","+  AboutRoute: typeof AboutRoute","+  PostsPostIdRoute: typeof PostsPostIdRoute","+}","+","+declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {","+  interface FileRoutesByPath {","+    '/': {","+      id: '/'","+      path: '/'","+      fullPath: '/'","+      preLoaderRoute: typeof IndexRouteImport","+      parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","+    }","+    '/about': {","+      id: '/about'","+      path: '/about'","+      fullPath: '/about'","+      preLoaderRoute: typeof AboutRouteImport","+      parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","+    }","+    '/posts/$postId': {","+      id: '/posts/$postId'","+      path: '/posts/$postId'","+      fullPath: '/posts/$postId'","+      preLoaderRoute: typeof PostsPostIdRouteImport","+      parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","+    }","+  }","+}","+","+const rootRouteChildren: RootRouteChildren = {","+  IndexRoute: IndexRoute,","+  AboutRoute: AboutRoute,","+  PostsPostIdRoute: PostsPostIdRoute,","+}","+export const routeTree = rootRouteImport","+  ._addFileChildren(rootRouteChildren)","+  ._addFileTypes<FileRouteTypes>()"],"additions":95,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/routes/__root.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+import { Outlet, createRootRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+","+export const Route = createRootRoute({","+  component: Outlet,","+})"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/routes/about.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@","+import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+","+export const Route = createFileRoute('/about')({","+  component: AboutPage,","+})","+","+function AboutPage() {","+  return <main>about</main>","+}"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/routes/index.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@","+import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+import { LinkListToggle } from '../linkList'","+import { readyTestId } from '../../../shared'","+","+export const Route = createFileRoute('/')({","+  component: HomePage,","+})","+","+function HomePage() {","+  return (","+    <main>","+      <p data-testid={readyTestId}>home</p>","+      <LinkListToggle />","+    </main>","+  )","+}"],"additions":16,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/src/routes/posts.$postId.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+","+export const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({","+  component: PostPage,","+})","+","+function PostPage() {","+  const params = Route.useParams()","+","+  return <main>{`post ${params.postId}`}</main>","+}"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/tsconfig.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@","+{","+  \"extends\": \"../../../../../tsconfig.json\",","+  \"compilerOptions\": {","+    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",","+    \"jsxImportSource\": \"react\",","+    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,","+    \"types\": [\"node\", \"vite/client\", \"vitest/globals\"]","+  },","+  \"include\": [","+    \"speed.bench.ts\",","+    \"speed-intent.bench.ts\",","+    \"speed.flame.ts\",","+    \"setup.ts\",","+    \"vite.config.ts\",","+    \"../shared.ts\",","+    \"../../harness.ts\",","+    \"../../../setup-helpers.ts\",","+    \"../../../jsdom.ts\",","+    \"../../../vitest.setup.ts\",","+    \"./src/**/*\"","+  ]","+}"],"additions":22,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/react/vite.config.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@","+import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url'","+import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config'","+import react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'","+import codspeedPlugin from '@codspeed/vitest-plugin'","+import { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'","+import { cpuSimulationExecArgv } from '../../../../cpu-simulation'","+","+const rootDir = fileURLToPath(new URL('.', import.meta.url))","+","+export default defineConfig({","+  root: rootDir,","+  define: {","+    'process.env.NODE_ENV': JSON.stringify('production'),","+  },","+  plugins: [","+    !!(process.env.VITEST && process.env.WITH_INSTRUMENTATION) &&","+      codspeedPlugin(),","+    tanstackRouter({","+      target: 'react',","+      routesDirectory: `${rootDir}src/routes`,","+      generatedRouteTree: `${rootDir}src/routeTree.gen.ts`,","+    }),","+    react(),","+  ],","+  build: {","+    outDir: './dist',","+    emptyOutDir: true,","+    minify: false,","+    lib: {","+      entry: './src/main.tsx',","+      formats: ['es'],","+      fileName: 'app',","+    },","+  },","+  test: {","+    execArgv: cpuSimulationExecArgv(),","+    name: '@benchmarks/client-nav link-mount (react)',","+    watch: false,","+    environment: 'jsdom',","+    setupFiles: ['../../../vitest.setup.ts'],","+  },","+})"],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/shared.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,91 @@","+/**","+ * Shared definition of the `link-mount` scenario: the cost of mounting and","+ * unmounting a large list of `<Link>`s without navigating. Each step","+ * synchronously renders or removes the list on the index route, so the work","+ * is Link setup and teardown (href building, active state, effects and","+ * subscriptions), not route matching or loading.","+ *","+ * Two Link shapes cover both `buildLocation` paths: a plain `to=\"/about\"`","+ * and a `to=\"/posts/$postId\"` Link with `params`, `search` and `activeProps`.","+ * The default app keeps TanStack Router's `defaultPreload: false`; the intent","+ * app sets `defaultPreload: 'intent'`, which attaches Link's intent handlers.","+ */","+import type { ScenarioStep } from '../harness'","+","+// 150 rows x 2 Link shapes = 300 Links per mount.","+export const LINK_ROW_COUNT = 150","+export const LINKS_PER_ROW = 2","+export const expectedLinkCount = LINK_ROW_COUNT * LINKS_PER_ROW","+","+export const linkRows = Array.from({ length: LINK_ROW_COUNT }, (_, index) => ({","+  postId: String(index + 1),","+  page: (index % 5) + 1,","+}))","+","+export const readyTestId = 'link-mount-ready'","+export const linkListTestId = 'link-list'","+","+export type LinkMountPreload = 'default' | 'intent'","+","+/** Sets whether the index route renders the Link list; resolves once rendered. */","+export type SetLinksVisible = (visible: boolean) => void | Promise<void>","+","+export function createScenarioSteps(","+  setLinksVisible: SetLinksVisible,","+): ReadonlyArray<ScenarioStep> {","+  return [","+    { type: 'run', run: () => setLinksVisible(true) },","+    { type: 'run', run: () => setLinksVisible(false) },","+  ]","+}","+","+// Anchor index -> expected href, checked after every warm-up mount. Even","+// indexes are `/about` Links, odd indexes the param Link of the same row.","+const sampledHrefs: ReadonlyArray<readonly [number, string]> = [","+  [0, '/about'],","+  [1, '/posts/1?page=1'],","+  [2 * 41 + 1, '/posts/42?page=2'],","+  [expectedLinkCount - 2, '/about'],","+  [expectedLinkCount - 1, `/posts/${LINK_ROW_COUNT}?page=5`],","+]","+","+export function assertStepResult(stepIndex: number, container: HTMLElement) {","+  const list = container.querySelector(`[data-testid=\"${linkListTestId}\"]`)","+","+  if (stepIndex === 1) {","+    if (list !== null) {","+      throw new Error('Expected the Link list to be unmounted')","+    }","+    return","+  }","+","+  const anchors = list?.querySelectorAll('a') ?? []","+  if (anchors.length !== expectedLinkCount) {","+    throw new Error(","+      `Expected ${expectedLinkCount} mounted Links, received ${anchors.length}`,","+    )","+  }","+  for (const [index, href] of sampledHrefs) {","+    const actual = anchors[index]!.getAttribute('href')","+    if (actual !== href) {","+      throw new Error(","+        `Expected Link ${index} to have href \"${href}\", received \"${actual}\"`,","+      )","+    }","+  }","+  if (list!.querySelector('a.active-link') !== null) {","+    throw new Error('Expected no active Link on the index route')","+  }","+}","+","+// One lap (a single mount/unmount cycle of 300 Links) per benchmark iteration.","+// CodSpeed simulation ignores `benchOptions` and runs setup, the warm-up lap","+// and one iteration 8 times within one test timeout; a lap keeps Vue's run","+// well inside it.","+export const ticksPerIteration = 2","+","+export const benchOptions = {","+  warmupIterations: 50,","+  time: 8_000,","+  throws: true,","+}"],"additions":91,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/solid/project.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@","+{","+  \"name\": \"@benchmarks/client-nav-link-mount-solid\",","+  \"projectType\": \"application\",","+  \"targets\": {","+    \"build:client\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"cache\": false,","+      \"dependsOn\": [","+        {","+          \"projects\": [\"@tanstack/solid-router\", \"@tanstack/router-plugin\"],","+          \"target\": \"build\"","+        }","+      ],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"NODE_ENV=production vite build --config {projectRoot}/vite.config.ts\"","+      }","+    },","+    \"test:types:client\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"dependsOn\": [","+        {","+          \"projects\": [\"@tanstack/solid-router\", \"@tanstack/router-plugin\"],","+          \"target\": \"build\"","+        }","+      ],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"tsc -p {projectRoot}/tsconfig.json --noEmit\"","+      }","+    },","+    \"test:flame\": {","+      \"executor\": \"nx:run-commands\",","+      \"cache\": false,","+      \"dependsOn\": [\"build:client\"],","+      \"options\": {","+        \"command\": \"NODE_ENV=production flame run --md-format=detailed --delay=none --node-options=\\\"--stack-size=65500\\\" ./scenarios/link-mount/solid/speed.flame.ts\",","+        \"cwd\": \"benchmarks/client-nav\"","+      }","+    }","+  }","+}"],"additions":40,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/solid/setup.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+import { createScenarioSetup } from '../../harness'","+import { assertStepResult, createScenarioSteps, readyTestId } from '../shared'","+import type { LinkMountPreload } from '../shared'","+import type * as App from './src/main'","+","+const appModulePath = './dist/app.js'","+const { mountIntentTestApp, mountTestApp, setLinksVisible } = (await import(","+  /* @vite-ignore */ appModulePath","+)) as typeof App","+","+export function setup(preload: LinkMountPreload = 'default') {","+  return createScenarioSetup({","+    frameworkLabel: 'Solid',","+    mount: preload === 'intent' ? mountIntentTestApp : mountTestApp,","+    steps: createScenarioSteps(setLinksVisible),","+    assertAfterStep: assertStepResult,","+    readyTestId,","+  })","+}"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"benchmarks/client-nav/scenarios/link-mount/solid/speed-intent.bench.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@","+import { test } from 'vitest'","+import { benchLifecycle } from '../../../../cpu-simulation'","+import { benchOptions, ticksPerIteration } from '../shared'","+import { setup } from './setup'","+","+// Separate file, so its worker's JIT feedback never mixes the two router","+// configurations.","+test('client-link-mount-intent', async ({ bench }) => {","+  const scenario = setup('intent')","+","+  await bench(","+    'client-link-mount intent loop (solid)',","+    benchLifecycle(scenario),","+    async () => {","+      for (let i = 0; i < ticksPerIteration; i++) {","+        await scenario.tick()","+      }","+      await scenario.finishBatch()","+    },","+  ).run(benchOptions)"],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":633,"deletions":1,"truncated":true,"file_count":21},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:03:12.048900+00:00"}